e the room vacant until a reservation holder arrives; keep the daily three-hour limit in mind.","short_summary":"A numbered upper-level study room governed by the library’s reservation rules.","evidence_claim":"Skillman’s upper-level plan identifies Ruthizer Study Room as Room 217; Lafayette permits study-room reservations.","source_url":"https://library.lafayette.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/named_spaces_upper.pdf","source_title":"Skillman Library Named Spaces — Upper Level","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Library rooms may be booked in half-hour increments for up to three hours per user per day, as far as three days ahead.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lafayette-brenninger-reading-area","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Brenninger Reading Area","title":"Move Downstairs for a Named Reading Area","subtitle":"Skillman Library · Lower level","notes":"Bring sustained reading to this lower-level area, using the official floor plan to distinguish it from nearby rooms and study zones.","short_summary":"A named lower-level alternative to Skillman’s formal upstairs reading rooms.","evidence_claim":"Skillman Library’s official lower-level plan identifies the Brenninger Reading Area as a distinct named space.","source_url":"https://library.lafayette.edu/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/named-spaces-lower.pdf","source_title":"Skillman Library Named Spaces — Lower Level","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available during Skillman Library hours; no reservation requirement is stated on the official floor plan.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lafayette-private-study-booth-lower-level","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Skillman Lower-Level Private Study Booth","title":"Book the White-Noise Study Booth","subtitle":"Skillman Library · Lower level near Room 004","notes":"Reserve this booth for solo work that benefits from added privacy, white noise, and integrated outlets; do not treat it as soundproof.","short_summary":"A reservable solo booth designed to dampen ambient noise while keeping devices powered.","evidence_claim":"Lafayette says the lower-level private study booth has white noise, integrated power outlets, and library-room-style reservations.","source_url":"https://library.lafayette.edu/whats-new-in-skillman/","source_title":"What’s New in Skillman?","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-08-20","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reserve through the library’s LibCal system; the booth is near Room 004 and is private but not soundproof.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
